# Pilot readiness (P-10) — deliberately references work that does not exist yet.
#
# ⚠️ The stages below whose scripts are absent report **NOT IMPLEMENTED**, never a pass. A profile
# that silently skipped them would show a green pilot-readiness run for a pilot nobody has verified,
# which is the exact failure this framework is supposed to make impossible.
# `requires` accepts stage ids, or the token `always` — which means "run even if the run
# aborted". Only the report uses it: an aborted night is the one that most needs a written summary.

preflight    | Pre-flight checks                 | preflight.sh    | RUN_PREFLIGHT   |           | abort    | TIMEOUT_PREFLIGHT
gate         | Production gate                   | gate.sh         | RUN_GATE        | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_GATE
deployment   | Deployment integrity              | deployment.sh   | RUN_DEPLOYMENT  | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_DEPLOYMENT
boundary     | Contracts and perception boundary | boundary.sh     | RUN_BOUNDARY    | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_BOUNDARY
runtime      | Real inference, end to end        | runtime.sh      | RUN_RUNTIME     | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
dashboard    | Operator page in a browser        | dashboard.sh    | RUN_DASHBOARD   | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_DASHBOARD
integration  | Cross-service integration tests   | integration.sh  | RUN_INTEGRATION | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_INTEGRATION
stability    | Long stability run                | stability.sh    | RUN_SOAK        | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_SOAK
benchmark    | Capacity ladder and benchmark     | benchmark.sh    | RUN_BENCHMARK   | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_BENCHMARK
journeys     | Customer journeys end to end      | pilot-journey.sh| RUN_JOURNEYS    | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
evidence     | Evidence export and chain of custody | pilot-evidence.sh | RUN_EVIDENCE | preflight | continue | TIMEOUT_RUNTIME
report       | Morning summary                   | report.sh       | RUN_REPORT      | always   | continue | TIMEOUT_REPORT
